    {"type":"text","id":"problem_title","x":50,"y":490,"width":200,"height":25,"text":"The Problem","originalText":"The Problem","fontSize":20,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#b91c1c","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":40020,"version":1,"versionNonce":40021,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.25},
    {"type":"text","id":"problem_text","x":50,"y":518,"width":1020,"height":70,"text":"The original query only matched Pattern 1: (c)-[:UPSTREAM]->(m)-[]-(md:Manifest)\nWhen m IS the Manifest (Pattern 3), (m)-[]-(md:Manifest) requires a SECOND Manifest connected to m.\nSince CE manifests are standalone (not connected to other manifests), the MATCH found nothing = silent empty result.","originalText":"The original query only matched Pattern 1: (c)-[:UPSTREAM]->(m)-[]-(md:Manifest)\nWhen m IS the Manifest (Pattern 3), (m)-[]-(md:Manifest) requires a SECOND Manifest connected to m.\nSince CE manifests are standalone (not connected to other manifests), the MATCH found nothing = silent empty result.","fontSize":13,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#374151","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":40030,"version":1,"versionNonce":40031,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.25},

